    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I have a cautious and somewhat distant relationship with mathematics. Although I enjoy learning about economics and history, math feels abstract and challenging, especially given my lower secondary education background. I often rely on intuition rather than calculations, and while I recognize its importance, I avoid deep engagement with it unless necessary for practical tasks like budgeting or analyzing data.",
